    "complexity": "Complex",
    "description": "Ominous storm clouds gather overhead, pulsating with flashes of blue-white lightning.",
    "disable": "DC 23 Religion (trained) to petition Gozreh for safe passage or 28 Arcana, Nature, or Occultism (expert) to disperse the storm\u2019s magical energies. A PC whose voice is exceptionally loud (such as using the *bullhorn* cantrip) can also attempt to Disable this hazard with a DC 25 Diplomacy check to convince the Gozren priests that they mean no harm; the priests make a second prayer to dissipate the hazard on the following round, though they\u2019re unable to stop the sargassum heaps.",
