    "name": "Rage of the Sky Father",
    "reset": "The storm clouds disperse once no creature other than those designated by Katlanthe are atop the plateau.",
    "routine": "(1 action) (divine, electricity) A bolt of lightning strikes a 10-foot burst atop the plateau of the GM\u2019s choosing. Creatures in the area take 2d10+9 electricity damage (DC 28 Reflex save). On a critical failure, the creature is also stunned 1. Creatures designated by Katlanthe within the area are infused with divine energy for 1 round. They gain the electricity trait and immunity to electricity damage, and all their attacks deal an additional 1d6 electricity damage.",
